1. Delete scopedToItsControl and replace it with an explicit allowlist. Its only entry is {file: src/components/ui/select.tsx, scope: the exact statement at select.tsx:289, whitespace-normalised}. A listener is exempt only when all three of these hold:
   - its file is on the allowlist;
   - that pinned statement appears in its handler before the first Enter;
   - the file has exactly one window or document listener that reads Enter.
   The last condition stops a second listener from riding the entry. That includes a second `const onKey`, which the first-definition resolver at enter-where-pressed.test.mts:107 would match to the exempt handler. Any other handler that reads Enter fails 2.1, whatever it checks first.

